/T (Netflix wanted to grow fast and improve its recommendation system, however, the company was still a startup with not a lot of resources. In October 2006, Netflix presented the Netflix Prize, an open competition to create an accurate, efficient collaborative filtering algorithm better than Cinematch for its recommendation system. Cinematch was 9.6% more accurate than simply predicting movie averages.)
